  "notes": "Core Plaid API auth is client_id/secret (api_key style), sent via headers PLAID-CLIENT-ID/PLAID-SECRET or request body; not OAuth2/bearer for developer access (Plaid Link uses OAuth for end-user bank login, which is a separate concern from developer API auth). Free self-serve Sandbox account obtainable via Dashboard signup with no sales contact required; Production access requires additional verification/compliance review per Plaid policy but is still self-serve initiated. MCP: no official vendor-published MCP server page could be confirmed (docs/mcp and docs/ai-tools paths 404'd); registry and third-party (Composio) list a community/wrapped MCP server plus several community GitHub MCP repos (e.g. plaid/ai-coding-toolkit, 304techmaven/plaid-mcp-server), so classified as community pending direct confirmation.",
